# Data stores

- Ship schema changes through Alembic in `packages/store`. The ingestion service owns writes to `commerce_events` and `ingestion_quarantine`.
- Store the canonical envelope. Do not reshape it into a warehouse model on Day 1.
- `ingested_at` is database write time. `occurred_at` is business time. API copy must keep them distinct.
- Persisted row counts are not Kafka throughput.
- ClickHouse may have an empty database. Do not load sample analytical data to make it look active.
- Use timezone-aware UTC timestamps in the operational store.
